## Goals

One match goal. team_id identifies the credited team; player_team_id identifies the scorer’s team. Own goals do not count toward personal scoring totals. Shootout kicks are recorded separately.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| goal_id | Goal ID | string | Stable goal identifier; join using this value. | goal_id |
| tournament_id | Tournament ID | string | Stable tournament identifier; join using this value. | tournament_id |
| tournament_name | Tournament Name | string | Recorded tournament name. | tournament_name |
| match_id | Match ID | string | Stable match identifier; join using this value. | match_id |
| match_name | Match Name | string | Recorded match name. | match_name |
| match_date | Match Date | string | Local match date as recorded, in YYYY-MM-DD format. | match_date |
| stage_name | Stage Name | string | Recorded competition stage, such as group stage or final. | stage_name |
| group_name | Group Name | string | Recorded group name; not applicable for some knockout matches. | group_name |
| team_id | Team ID | string | Stable team identifier; join using this value. | team_id |
| team_name | Team Name | string | Recorded team name. | team_name |
| team_code | Team Code | string | Recorded team code. | team_code |
| home_team | Home Side | integer | 1 for the designated home side, otherwise 0; not the host-country flag. | home_team |
| away_team | Away Side | integer | 1 for the designated away side, otherwise 0. | away_team |
| player_id | Player ID | string | Stable player identifier; join using this value. | player_id |
| family_name | Family Name | string | Recorded family name; use the person ID to identify a unique individual. | family_name |
| given_name | Given Name | string | Recorded given name, preserving source spelling and accents. | given_name |
| shirt_number | Shirt Number | integer | Recorded squad or match shirt number. | shirt_number |
| player_team_id | Player Team ID | string | Identity of the player’s team; may differ from the credited team on an own goal. | player_team_id |
| player_team_name | Player Team Name | string | Name of the player’s team; may differ from the credited team on an own goal. | player_team_name |
| player_team_code | Player Team Code | string | Code of the player’s team. | player_team_code |
| minute_label | Minute Label | string | Recorded event minute, retaining stoppage-time notation. | minute_label |
| minute_regulation | Regulation Minute | integer | Regulation component of the recorded event minute. | minute_regulation |
| minute_stoppage | Stoppage Minute | integer | Stoppage-time component of the recorded event minute. | minute_stoppage |
| match_period | Match Period | string | Match period containing the event. | match_period |
| own_goal | Own Goal | integer | 1 for an own goal, otherwise 0; exclude these rows from personal goal totals. | own_goal |
| penalty | Match Penalty | integer | 1 for a goal from a match penalty, otherwise 0; not a shootout kick. | penalty |

